message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ToothNotation: conversion between dental tooth-numbering systems"
abstract: "A dependency-free library and interactive odontogram for converting between FDI (ISO 3950), Universal, and Palmer dental tooth-numbering systems, using FDI as a canonical representation and verified by exhaustive round-trip tests."
authors:
  - family-names: "Hezarani"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-06-10
license: MIT
keywords:
  - dentistry
  - tooth numbering
  - FDI
  - ISO 3950
  - Universal numbering
  - Palmer notation
